{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":3,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Soba is made of buckwheat flour, and udon and kishimen are made of plain wheat flour.","ja":"そばはそば粉から、うどんやきしめんは普通の小麦粉からできてるの。","ref":"327107_76613","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["雲呑","饂飩"],"glosses":["wonton (Chinese dumpling)","won ton","wantan","wanton","wuntun"],"id":"1173250","lemma":"雲呑","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ワンタン","readings":["ワンタン"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/ワンタン#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/ワ/ワン/ワンタン.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/雲呑#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/雲/雲呑/雲呑.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["馄饨。","餛飩"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["馄饨。"],"pos":""},{"examples":[],"glosses":["餛飩"],"pos":"n"}]},{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Three of the planes have not yet reported home.","ja":"そのうち３機はまだ帰還の報告はない。","ref":"50670_213384","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Break for bath & food, back in about 40 minutes!","ja":"一旦風呂＆飯落ち、４０分ぐらいして帰還！","ref":"416470_347540","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"She prayed for her son's return.","ja":"彼女は息子の帰還を祈った。","ref":"315583_88124","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["帰還","饋還"],"glosses":["return (home)","repatriation","feedback (in an electronic circuit, biological system, etc.)"],"id":"1221300","lemma":"帰還","pos":["n","vs","vi","vt"],"readingKata":"キカン","readings":["きかん"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/帰還#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/帰/帰還/帰還.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["帰還【きかん】 名·自サ 1. (从战场等)归来。 基地に帰還する 返回基地。 2. 反馈，回授。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["帰還【きかん】 名·自サ 1. (从战场等)归来。 基地に帰還する 返回基地。 2. 反馈，回授。"],"pos":""}]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Some people in the world suffer from hunger.","ja":"世界には飢えに苦しむ人々も居る。","ref":"271120_143447","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Hunger is perhaps the strongest of all human drives.","ja":"人間を行動に駆りたてるもののうち、飢えが恐らく最も強力であろう。","ref":"270331_144234","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Hunger is one of the strongest griefs.","ja":"飢えは最大の社会的不幸の１つである。","ref":"20079_182957","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Hunger knows no law.","ja":"飢えの前に法律はない。","ref":"20078_182958","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"It was hunger that impelled him to crime.","ja":"飢えのために彼はやむなく罪を犯した。","ref":"20080_182959","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["飢え","餓え","饑え"],"glosses":["hunger","starvation"],"id":"1224070","lemma":"飢え","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ウエ","readings":["うえ"],"sourceUrls":[],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["飢えるcontinuative飢えるimperfective"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["飢えるcontinuative飢えるimperfective"],"pos":"non-lemma"}]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":["*/uwu/ → /uweru/ → /ueru/ 源自文語動詞 飢う (uu)。 發展 自然地從上古日語和古典日語的下(しも)二(に)段(だん)活(かつ)用(よう) (shimo nidan katsuyō)，-u 結尾的動詞發展為現代日語的下(しも)一(いち)段(だん)活(かつ)用(よう) (shimo ichidan katsuyō)，-eru 結尾的動詞。","源自文語動詞 飢う (katuu)。 發展 自然地從上古日語和古典日語的下(しも)二(に)段(だん)活(かつ)用(よう) (shimo nidan katsuyō)，-u 結尾的動詞發展為現代日語的下(しも)一(いち)段(だん)活(かつ)用(よう) (shimo ichidan katsuyō)，-eru 結尾的動詞。"],"examples":[{"ja":"我々は人が飢えるのを黙って見ていられない。","source":"wty","zh":"我們不能袖手旁觀，看著人們挨餓。"},{"ja":"みなし子は親の愛情に飢える。","source":"wty","zh":"孤兒渴望父母的愛。"},{"ja":"革命のときはみんながかつえたけれど、いま、パンは、たっぷりなんだから遠慮はいらないことさ。","ref":"宮本百合子《道標》：","source":"wty","zh":"革命的時候大家都挨餓了，但現在麵包有的是，所以不需要客氣。"},{"ja":"噂にしても、誰も明るい噂に餓えかつえているときだった。","ref":"橫光利一《微笑》：","source":"wty","zh":"那時哪怕只是傳言，大家也都希望聽到一些好消息。"},{"en":"He has a hunger for kindness after fame.","ja":"彼は親切に飢えている。","ref":"300064_103629","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["飢える","餓える","饑える"],"glosses":["to starve","to be famished","to be hungry","to be starved of (e.g. love)","to be thirsty for (e.g. knowledge)","to be hungry for"],"id":"1224080","lemma":"飢える","pos":["v1","vi"],"readingKata":"ウエル","readings":["うえる","かつえる"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/飢える#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/mean